---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Account Deletion"
  description="How to delete a LittlePickle player profile or request deletion of a league-administrator account."
>
  <section>
    <h2>Delete a player profile in the app</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open LittlePickle and select the <strong>Profile</strong> tab.</li>
      <li>Select <strong>Delete profile</strong>.</li>
      <li>Review the deletion notice and confirm <strong>Delete profile</strong>.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      The player profile becomes unavailable immediately and is removed from active app views and queues.
      You do not need to email support to start this process.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What happens during deletion</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The profile is unavailable immediately.</li>
      <li>Support or a league administrator can restore it during a 30-day recovery period.</li>
      <li>
        After 30 days, the display name is replaced with “Deleted player,” the profile photo is removed,
        the rating is reset, and the player’s rating-change ledger is deleted.
      </li>
      <li>
        Past match participation may remain under the anonymized player record so league match history and
        completed results stay accurate.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Delete a league-administrator login</h2>
    <p>
      To request deletion of an email-based league-administrator login and associated personal
      information, email
      <a href="mailto:support@joinlittlepickle.com?subject=Delete%20my%20LittlePickle%20account">
        support@joinlittlepickle.com
      </a>
      from the address used for the account. Include the league name so we can identify the correct
      account. We may ask for additional verification before completing the request.
    </p>
    <div class="legal-actions">
      <a
        class="legal-button"
        href="mailto:support@joinlittlepickle.com?subject=Delete%20my%20LittlePickle%20account"
      >
        Request account deletion
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Need help or want to restore a profile?</h2>
    <p>
      Contact <a href="mailto:support@joinlittlepickle.com">support@joinlittlepickle.com</a> during the
      30-day recovery period or ask a league administrator to restore the player profile.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
